        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐸 FrogShot</strong> is a platformer game that introduces a new way of moving around - with your tongue!👅   <br><br>Get freaky and use it as:<br>- a grappling hook to gain momentum to get anywhere you want! <br>- to slingshot yourself across the map!<br>-  to control mechanisms: lick a button or two!<br>- move around by sticking your tongue into the ground, walls and many other crevices!<br>- leap  by launching yourself off the ground! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the silly lookin frog through various dangers in unique worlds and enjoy your one handed gameplay. Each world offers you a core mechanic and 3 side ones. Brace yourself as the difficulty level rises and put your coordination and reflexes to test while <strong>YOU </strong>struggle to eat buzzing flies and finish levels as fast as you can!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>McFrog Station</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Venture into a sci-fi space station - go two handed mode and bend gravity to your will while dodging deadly lasers trying to keep you away from your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/0822c2b36800e4b505fa3ea1dbef2788.poster.avif?t=1763389761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/0822c2b36800e4b505fa3ea1dbef2788.webm?t=1763389761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/0822c2b36800e4b505fa3ea1dbef2788.mp4?t=1763389761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Icy Mountains</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Enjoy frost covered world with an occasional snow storm throwing you off your game, alongside slippery ice-floor, tricky teleporters and icicles trying to turn you into popsicle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/5fc1b27579b0be89ea69189d920da593.poster.avif?t=1763389761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/5fc1b27579b0be89ea69189d920da593.webm?t=1763389761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/5fc1b27579b0be89ea69189d920da593.mp4?t=1763389761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Abandoned Factory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face new challenges with your trusty compressor pack — let the pressure carry you through danger. But be careful: faster isn’t always better. Will you escape, or end up as a pancake on the autonomous belts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/727c8c1268a1d4f70aa4dce09f5e012a.poster.avif?t=1763389761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/727c8c1268a1d4f70aa4dce09f5e012a.webm?t=1763389761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/727c8c1268a1d4f70aa4dce09f5e012a.mp4?t=1763389761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Dark Caverns</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Penetrate deep caverns with limited vision, the only warmth you have is your little lamp that runs out if you aren’t swift enough. Try to not get yourself blown up! The sleeker you are the better! <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/ff0e6137f68bbe430f477f4e732219e9.poster.avif?t=1763389761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/ff0e6137f68bbe430f477f4e732219e9.webm?t=1763389761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986350/extras/ff0e6137f68bbe430f477f4e732219e9.mp4?t=1763389761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>It’s in your hands to get this silly guy through it all.</strong><br><strong>See if you can make it.</strong></p>",
